Third-party content (not covered by the MIT License above)

CMIS_5.3_Parameter_Reference.xlsx and CMIS_5.3_Memory_Map.csv contain content
derived from OIF-CMIS-05.3, Common Management Interface Specification
revision 5.3, published by the Optical Internetworking Forum (OIF),
https://www.oiforum.com/. This includes field names, register addresses,
access/requirement types and field description text, which is reproduced
verbatim in the Description column. That content remains the property of the
OIF and is subject to the OIF's terms; the MIT License applies only to the
original work in this repository (the scripts in tools/, and the workbook's
structure, normalization, Key IDs, corrections and cross-check columns).

tools/data/sonic_cmis_fields.json is derived from sonic-net/sonic-platform-common
(https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-platform-common), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0.
